    {
      "id": "1df424c8cf96-q1",
      "number": 1,
      "question": "Study the given pattern carefully and select the number that can replace the question mark (?) in it. 5 9 5 7 3 ? 148 180 292",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Study the given pattern carefully and select the number that can replace the question mark&nbsp;(?) in it.</p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width:200px;\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">5</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">9</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">5</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">7</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">3</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">?</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">148</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">180</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">292</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "10",
          "html": "10"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "12",
          "html": "12"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "11",
          "html": "11"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "9",
          "html": "9"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>The logic followed here is :</p>\n\n<p><strong>(1st number<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ 2nd number<sup>2</sup>)&nbsp;&times; 2 = 3rd number</strong></p>\n\n<p>(5<sup>2&nbsp;</sup>+ 7<sup>2</sup>)&nbsp;&times; 2 = (25 + 49)&nbsp;&times; 2 = 74&nbsp;&times; 2 = 148</p>\n\n<p>Similarly,&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">(9</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">+ 3</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">)&nbsp;&times; 2 = (81&nbsp;+ 9)&nbsp;&times; 2 = 90&nbsp;&times; 2 = 180</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Therefore,</span></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"\">(5</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">+ X</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">)&nbsp;&times; 2 = 292</span></strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; (25 + X<sup>2</sup> )&nbsp;&times; 2 = &nbsp;292&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; 50 + 2X<sup>2</sup> = 292</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; 2X<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 292 - 50</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; 2X<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 242</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; X<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 121</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; <strong>X = 11.</strong></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Hence, the correct answer is <strong>&quot;11&quot;.</strong></span></p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "1df424c8cf96-q2",
      "number": 2,
      "question": "Select the number that can replace the question mark (?) in the following figure series.",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Select the number that can replace the question mark (?) in the following figure series.</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/02/F1_Pooja.S_12-02-21_Savita_D19.png\" style=\"width: 342px; height: 95px;\" /></p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
