          "id": "D",
          "text": "18",
          "html": "18"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p>The logic follows here is :</p>\n\n<p><strong>(Sum of numbers at the base) - Number at the top = Number in the middle</strong></p>\n\n<p>For figure A :</p>\n\n<p>(14 + 18) - 8 = 32 - 8 = 24.</p>\n\n<p>For figure B :</p>\n\n<p>(2 + 8) - 2 = 10 - 2 = 8.</p>\n\n<p>Similarly,</p>\n\n<p><strong>For figure C :</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>(12 + 10) - 4 = 22 - 4 = 18.</strong></p>\n\n<p>Hence, the correct answer is <strong>\"18\".</strong></p>\n",
