      "solution": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">The logic follows here is: </span><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">42 × 18 ÷ 3 </span><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">= 42 × 6 = 252</span></p>\n\n<p>Similarly, 45 × 36 ÷ 3 = 45 × 12 = 540</p>\n",
