      "question": "Which number should come in place of the question mark (?) in the following chart: 61 43 66 23 11 10 1405 475 ?",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Which number should come in place of the question mark (?) in the following chart:</p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:29px;height:23px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">61</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:29px;height:23px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">43</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:29px;height:23px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">66</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:29px;height:23px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">23</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:29px;height:23px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">11</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:29px;height:23px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">10</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:29px;height:23px;\">\n\t\t\t<p>1405</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:29px;height:23px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">475</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width:29px;height:23px;\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">?</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n",
      "options": [
        {
