      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>The logic here is:</p>\n\n<p>Column 1: 61 &times; 23 = 1403 &rarr; 1403 + 2 = 1405</p>\n\n<p>Column 2: 43 &times; 11 = 473 &rarr; 473 + 2 = 475</p>\n\n<p>Similarly,</p>\n\n<p>Column 3: 66 &times; 10 = 660 &rarr; 660 + 2 = 662</p>\nHence, <strong>662</strong> is the correct answer.",
