      "questionHtml": "<p>Which character when placed at the sign of interrogation shall complete the given pattern?</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/06/F1_Shubham.B_24-06-21_Savita_D1.png\" style=\"width: 289px; height: 127px;\" /></p>\n",
