      "question": "Study the pattern in the first two pictures and then choose the number that can replace the question mark (?) in the third picture.",
      "questionHtml": "<p style=\"\">Study the pattern in the first two pictures and then choose the number that can replace the question mark (?) in the third picture.</p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/09/F3_Madhuri_State%20Govt._14.09.2022_D10.png\" style=\"height: 83px; width: 300px;\" /></p>\n",
