      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>The logic followed here is,</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; (23 + 15) - 32 = 38 - 32 = 6</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; (19&nbsp;+ 26) - 29&nbsp;= 45&nbsp;- 29&nbsp;= 16</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Similarly,</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; (27&nbsp;+ 9) - 18&nbsp;= 36&nbsp;- 18&nbsp;= 18</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">So, the missing term is <strong>18</strong>.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Hence, the correct answer is <strong>Option 2</strong>.</span></p>\n",
