        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "30",
          "html": "30"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "28",
          "html": "28"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>The logic followed here is;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Sum of all the corner numbers&nbsp;&times; 2 = Middle Number&nbsp;</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>Figure 1:</strong></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/10/F1_Vinanti_Defence_18.10.23_D40.png\" style=\"width: 88px; height: 88px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>(5 + 2 + 3 + 4)&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&times; 2&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">= 14&nbsp;&times; 2&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">= 28</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Figure 2:</strong></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/10/F1_Vinanti_Defence_18.10.23_D41.png\" style=\"width: 88px; height: 88px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>(6 + 1 + 4 + 2)&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&times; 2</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">= 13&nbsp;&times; 2</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">= 26</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Figure 3:</strong></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/10/F1_Vinanti_Defence_18.10.23_D42.png\" style=\"width: 88px; height: 87px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>(5 + 3 + 6 + 4)&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&times; 2</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">= 18&nbsp;&times; 2</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">= 36</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Hence, the correct answer is <strong>&quot;36&quot;.</strong></span></p>\n",
