      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>The pattern followed is,</p>\n\n<p>First column:&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span><span style=\"  background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">&rarr; 13<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;- 8<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 169 - 64 = 105</span></span></p>\n\n<p>Second column:&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">&rarr; 15</span><span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; white-space: pre-wrap;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;- 7</span><span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; white-space: pre-wrap;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;= 225 - 49 = 176</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Similarly, </span></p>\n\n<p>Third&nbsp;column:&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">&rarr; 17</span><span style=\"position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;- 9</span><span style=\"position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;= 289 - 81 = 208</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Hence, 208 is the correct answer.</span></p>\n",
