      "solution": "<p>The pattern followed here is</p>\n\n<p>4<sup>4&nbsp;</sup>+ 3<sup>4&nbsp;</sup>= 256 + 81 = 337</p>\n\n<p>3<sup>4&nbsp;</sup>+ 5<sup>4&nbsp;</sup>= 81 + 625 = 706</p>\n\n<p>6<sup>4&nbsp;</sup>+ 3<sup>4&nbsp;</sup>= 1296 + 81 = 1377</p>\n\n<p>Hence, <strong>1377 </strong>is the correct answer.</p>\n",
