      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>The pattern followed here is:</p>\n\n<p><strong>Logic is followed horizontally.</strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 700; \">Third number =&nbsp;</span><strong>(First number of the row &times;&nbsp;second number) - &nbsp;(second number)/2&nbsp;</strong></p>\n\n<p>So,</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>First row :</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&rArr; (13 x 6) = 78 =&nbsp;78 - (6/2) = 78 - 3 =&nbsp;75</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Third row :</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"\">&rArr; (18&nbsp;x 4) =72 Then&nbsp;72&nbsp;- (4/2) = 72 - 2 =&nbsp;70</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">Similarly,</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Second row :</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"\">&rArr; (<strong>15&nbsp;x 8) = 120. Then,120&nbsp;- (8/2) = 120 - 4 = 116</strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">Hence, <strong>&quot;116&quot;</strong> is the correct answer.</p>\n",
